    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heroic Emblem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an original SRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The player controls the game and wins by annihilating the enemy camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have various abilities, such as characters that can attack the weak points of various enemies and characters that can unleash fixed damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and characters that can release fixed damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of these abilities to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the enemy's action patterns and weak points, and formulate a strategy to defeat the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon can be used to exploit the weakness of each enemy class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can be used to expand the range of tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was once a war between the Kingdom of Aura and the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result, the Kingdom of Aura was defeated and destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The son of the young King Aura lived in a remote place, keeping the truth hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than ten years have passed since then. The seven heroes rose up to revolt against the empire,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minato, son of King Aura, tells them the truth. And to defeat and destroy the empire,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seven heroes set out to defeat the empire and revive the kingdom of Aura. \u25c6Difficulty Level The strength of the enemies changes depending on the difficulty level you select. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
